      </section>

{/* WHY MPHONE */}
      <section className="section-in" style={{padding:"48px 20px",background:"#f5f5f7"}}>
        <h2 style={{fontSize:34,fontWeight:600,textAlign:"center",marginBottom:40,lineHeight:1.47059}}>Why mPhone</h2>
        <div className="stagger-grid" style={{maxWidth:900,margin:"0 auto",display:"grid",gridTemplateColumns:"repeat(3,1fr)",gap:20}}>
          {[{t:"Custom Silicon",d:"A-series chips designed for mPhone. Up to 40% faster performance per generation. Each new A-series chip delivers industry-leading CPU and GPU improvements, with a 16-core Neural Engine that powers advanced machine learning capabilities. The result is a phone that feels instant, responsive, and ready for anything."},{t:"Privacy by Design",d:"Your data stays yours ? always. On-device processing keeps your personal information private. Face ID data never leaves your device. iCloud data is encrypted end-to-end. Location data is shared only with your permission, and Safari prevents trackers from profiling you."},{t:"Seamless Ecosystem",d:"Works perfectly with all your Apple devices. Handoff calls between iPhone and Mac. Universal Clipboard for copy-paste across devices. AirDrop for instant file sharing. Continuity Camera lets you use your iPhone camera on your Mac. All powered by iCloud."}].map((f,i) => (
            <div key={i} className="stagger-item card-hover" style={{background:"#fff",borderRadius:18,padding:"32px 24px",border:"1px solid #e6e6ea",transition:"all 0.3s"}}>
              <p style={{fontSize:17,fontWeight:600,color:"#1d1d1f",marginBottom:8}}>{f.t}</p>
              <p style={{fontSize:14,color:"#6e6e73",lineHeight:1.47059}}>{f.d}</p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* ECOSYSTEM - expanded */}
      <section className="section-in" style={{padding:"48px 20px",background:"#000",color:"#f5f5f7"}}>
        <h2 style={{fontSize:34,fontWeight:600,textAlign:"center",marginBottom:32,lineHeight:1.47059,lineHeight:1.1}}>The mifan Ecosystem</h2>
        <div className="stagger-grid" style={{maxWidth:900,margin:"0 auto",display:"grid",gridTemplateColumns:"repeat(3,1fr)",gap:20}}>
          {[{t:"mifan Watch",d:"Track your health with advanced sensors including blood oxygen and ECG. Get notifications, take calls, and unlock your Mac. All from your wrist. With sleep tracking, workout detection, and fall detection, it is your ultimate health companion."},{t:"mifan AirPods",d:"Seamless pairing across all devices. Spatial audio with dynamic head tracking creates an immersive listening experience. Automatic device switching so you can go from iPhone to Mac without missing a beat. Up to 30 hours of battery life."},{t:"mifan iPad",d:"Universal Clipboard lets you copy on iPhone and paste on iPad. Sidecar turns your iPad into a second display for your Mac. Handoff calls and messages across devices. With iCloud, your documents, photos, and notes stay in sync everywhere."}].map((e,i) => (
            <div key={i} style={{background:"#1c1c1e",borderRadius:18,padding:"28px 24px",border:"1px solid #38383a"}}>
              <p style={{fontSize:17,fontWeight:600,color:"#f5f5f7",marginBottom:8}}>{e.t}</p>
              <p style={{fontSize:14,color:"#86868b",lineHeight:1.47059}}>{e.d}</p>
